## 11\'9612. `homepage_sections` and `homepage_featured_cafes`\
\
These let the CMS edit homepage content without duplicating cafe records.\
\
- `homepage_sections`: `section_id`, `section_key` UNIQUE, `title`, `body`, `media_path`, `link_label`, `link_url`, `sort_order`, `is_published`.\
- `homepage_featured_cafes`: `cafe_id` FK, `position`; composite primary key (`cafe_id`, `position`) or use `cafe_id` as PK with `position` UNIQUE.\
\
The CMS can edit hero/poster wording and choose/order featured cafe cards. The cafe\'92s name, price, image, and other details still come from its normal cafe record and related tables.\
\
**In short:** one `cafes` table for `niche_type` and `vibe` as separate fields, lookup/link tables for cuisines and amenities, a gallery table for images, and independent tables for users, favorites, reviews, and homepage content. The database should become the CMS source of truth when database/CMS implementation starts.}